exports[`keeps the Gemini-default provider card visible text unchanged (connected: false) 1`] = `"Optional online AI AI provider Google AI Studio opens in the default browser. The API key stays in your local application data folder and is not included in backups or SQLite. Gemini can turn a selected Study Library document into a study guide and flashcards. Only files you deliberately analyze are sent to Google. Personal notes, flight logs, profile details, and other library files are never sent. Gemini setup is available in the desktop application. Google states that free-tier content may be used to improve its products. Do not analyze medical records, certificates, addresses, or documents containing sensitive personal information. AI study material must be checked against the current source, FAA publications, aircraft documents, and her instructor. Use a different provider"`;

exports[`keeps the Gemini-default provider card visible text unchanged (connected: true) 1`] = `"Connected AI provider Google AI Studio opens in the default browser. The API key stays in your local application data folder and is not included in backups or SQLite. Gemini can turn a selected Study Library document into a study guide and flashcards. Only files you deliberately analyze are sent to Google. Personal notes, flight logs, profile details, and other library files are never sent. Ready to use Gemini 3.5 Flash · key saved on this computer Model for new study aids Standard — Gemini 3.5 Flash — Fast and inexpensive. Works with a free Google AI Studio key. Most capable — Gemini 3.8 Flash — Newer and a little more thorough; may use slightly more of your Google credits. Google states that free-tier content may be used to improve its products. Do not analyze medical records, certificates, addresses, or documents containing sensitive personal information. AI study material must be checked against the current source, FAA publications, aircraft documents, and her instructor. If Gemini keeps saying it is busy: A “busy” message means Google is overloaded, not that your key is wrong. Her Flight Deck already waits and retries; if it keeps happening, try again later or switch to Standard. Disconnect Gemini Use a different provider"`;
